  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Xét phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là phương trình đường tròn tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> bán kính <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Xét phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là phương trình đường tròn tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> bán kính <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Xét phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>15</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> không phải là phương trình đường tròn.</li><li>Xét phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>10</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là phương trình đường tròn tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và bán kính <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
